{'symbol': 'NDAQ', 'date': '2022-11-11 20:00:00', 'title': 'ENPHASE ENERGY, INC. TO JOIN THE NASDAQ-100 INDEX BEGINNING\xa0NOVEMBER 21, 2022', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NOV. 11, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NASDAQ (NASDAQ: NDAQ) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ENPHASE ENERGY, INC. (NASDAQ: ENPH) WILL BECOME A COMPONENT OF THE NASDAQ-100 INDEX® (NASDAQ: NDX) AND THE NASDAQ-100 EQUAL WEIGHTED INDEX (NASDAQ: NDXE) PRIOR TO MARKET OPEN ON MONDAY, NOVEMBER 21, 2022. ENPHASE ENERGY, INC. WILL REPLACE OKTA, INC. (NASDAQ: OKTA) IN THE NASDAQ-100 INDEX® AND THE NASDAQ-100 EQUAL WEIGHTED INDEX. OKTA, INC. WILL ALSO BE REMOVED FROM THE NASDAQ-100 TECHNOLOGY SECTOR INDEX (NASDAQ: NDXT) AND THE NASDAQ-100 TECHNOLOGY SECTOR MARKET-CAP WEIGHTED INDEX (NASDAQ: NDXTMC) PRIOR TO MARKET OPEN ON MONDAY, NOVEMBER 21, 2022.\xa0ENPHASE ENERGY, INC. WILL BE CONSIDERED FOR\xa0INCLUSION\xa0IN THE NASDAQ-100 EX-TECHNOLOGY INDEX (NASDAQ: NDXX) AT THE NEXT QUARTERLY REBALANCING.'}